\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  \'d0\u7875\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7889\'3ft vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f  ki\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft trong c\u7843\'3f n\'fd
\u7899\'3fc theo \'f0\'fang c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi  c\'e1c quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 148/CT ng\'e0y 21 th\'e1ng 5 n\'e3m 1982 v\'e0 quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh 228/CT ng\'e0y 14/6/1984 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0
\u7891\'3fng B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng; c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o t\'ednh ch\u7845\'3ft ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng XSKT \u7903\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f
 35/CP ng\'e0y 9/2/1981}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1838942  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f quy \'f0
\u7883\'3fnh nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f, quy\u7873\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng v\'e0 ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3ng c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f trong m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f l\u297\'3fnh v\u7921\'3fc qu\u7843
\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd\u7899\'3fc, sau khi c\'f3 s\u7921\'3f th\u7887\'3fa thu
\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa Ban t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f, B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn v\u7873\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc tr\'e1ch, nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f, t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc b\u7897\'3f m\'e1y, bi\'ea
n ch\u7871\'3f v\'e0 ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng c\u7911\'3fa t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc XSKT \u7903\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng nh\'fd sau:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  1/ }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 T\'ean g\u7885\'3fi:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  B\u7897\'3f m\'e1y l\'e0m nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f XSKT \u7903\'3f c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f v\'e0 \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3f
c g\u7885\'3fi th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft l\'e0 C\'f4ng ty ph\'e1t h\'e0nh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft (g\u7885\'3fi t\u7855\'3ft l\'e0 c\'f4
ng ty x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f ki\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft).
\par  2/ }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 V\u7883\'3f tr\'ed ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3ng, nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa C\'f4ng ty XSKT}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 .
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  C\'f4ng ty XSKT l\'e0  t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh, c\'f3 ch\u7913\'3fc n\'e3ng gi\'fap S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch
\'ednh th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh XSKT tr\'ean }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f0\u7883\'3fa b\'e0n l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'e3nh t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 h\u7893\'3f. C\'f4ng ty XSKT h\u7885\'3fat \'f0\u7897\'3fng theo ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n kinh t\u7871\'3f, c\'f3 t\'fd c\'e1ch ph\'e1p nh\'e2n \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc vay v\u7889\'3f
n c\u7911\'3fa ng\'e2n h\'e0ng v\'e0 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\'edch l\u7853\'3fp c\'e1c qu\u7929\'3f theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh , \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc m\u7903\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd
\u7899\'3fc, \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc d\'f9ng con d\u7845\'3fu ri\'eang \'f0\u7875\'3f giao d\u7883\'3fch.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  C\'f4ng ty XSKT c\'f3}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  nh\u7919\'3fng nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f v\'e0 quy\u7873
\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  a) T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc v\'e0 qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd ph\'e1t h\'e0nh, quay s\u7889\'3f m\u7903\'3f th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd\u7903\'3fng, tr\u7843\'3f th\'fd\u7903\'3fng v\'e9 XSKT trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng theo \'f0\'fang ch\'ednh s\'e1ch, ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0
\u7891\'3fng B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 th\'f4ng t\'fd, quy ch\u7871\'3f hu\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  b) }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 X\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\'e0 t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913
\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn c\'f4ng t\'e1c th\'f4ng tin tuy\'ean truy\u7873\'3fn v\u7873\'3f XSKT m\u7897\'3ft c\'e1ch th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean, r\u7897\'3fng kh\u7855\'3fp trong \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng nh\u7857\'3fm \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843
\'3fo cho ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng XSKT ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn \'f0\'fang h\'fd\u7899\'3fng v\'e0 l\'e0nh m\u7841\'3fnh.
\par  c) X\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ph\'e1t h\'e0nh v\'e9 x\u7893\'3f s\u7889\'3f, k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch Trung \'fd\'f5ng, chi t\'e0i ch\'ednh h\'e0ng n\'e3m, qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd m\u7897\'3ft c\'e1ch t\'edch c\u7921\'3fc.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  d) K\'fd k\u7871\'3ft c\'e1c h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f5 quan c\'f3 li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc in v\'e9, cung c\u7845\'3fp v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, h\'e0ng h\'f3a, v\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn ,... theo \'f0\'fang c\'e1c ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897
\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par  e) Nghi\'eam ch\u7881\'3fnh ch\u7845\'3fp h\'e0nh ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0 b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n, th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea, ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f chi ti\'eau t\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par  g) T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc m\'e0ng l\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7841\'3fi l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd b\'e1n v\'e9 XSKT theo \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'e0i ch\'ednh. C\'f9ng v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c ng\'e0nh, c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 li\'ean quan \'f0\u7845\'3fu tranh ch\u7889\'3fng c\'e1c bi\u7875\'3fu hi\u7879\'3fn ti
\'eau c\u7921\'3fc trong vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e1t h\'e0nh v\'e0 b\'e1n v\'e9 XSKT.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  h) X\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng v\'e0 qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd t\u7889\'3ft }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f0\u7897\'3f
i ng\u361\'3f c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f l\'e0m c\'f4ng t\'e1c XSKT theo \'f0\'fang quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  3/ }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 V\u7873\'3f ph\'e2n h\u7841\'3fng v\'e0 bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f ti\u7873\'3f
n l\'fd\'f5ng c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng ty}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 :
\par  a) }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 V\u7873\'3f ph\'e2n h\u7841\'3fng c\'f4ng ty}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 :
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  C\'f4ng ty XSKT \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e2n l\'e0m 4 h\u7841\'3fng, c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o s\u7889\'3f t\'edch l\u361\'3fy th\u7921\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s
\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc h\'e0ng n\'e3m:
\par  - C\'f4ng ty h\u7841\'3fng 1 c\'f3 s\u7889\'3f t\'edch l\u361\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch h\'e0ng n\'e3m t\u7915\'3f 300 tri\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7891\'3fng tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean.
\par  - C\'f4ng ty h\u7841\'3fng 2 c\'f3 s\u7889\'3f t\'edch l\u361\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch h\'e0ng n\'e3m t\u7915\'3f 150 tri\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0\u7871\'3fn d\'fd\u7899\'3fi 300 tri\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  - C\'f4ng ty h\u7841\'3fng 3 c\'f3 s\u7889\'3f t\'edch l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \u361\'3fy n\u7897\'3f
p Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch h\'e0ng n\'e3m t\u7915\'3f 100 tri\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0\u7871\'3fn d\'fd\u7899\'3fi 150 tri\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par  - C\'f4ng ty h\u7841\'3fng 4 c\'f3 s\u7889\'3f t\'edch l\u361\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch h\'e0ng n\'e3m d\'fd\u7899\'3fi 100 tri\u7879\'3fu \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par  Vi\u7879\'3fc ph\'e2n h\u7841\'3fng c\'f4ng ty \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f n\'e3m 1987 d\u7921\'3fa tr\'ean k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch n\u7897\'3fp t\'edch l\u361\'3fy n\'e3m 1987; sau \'f0\'f3 c\'e3n c\u7913
\'3f v\'e0o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0ng n\'e3m, c\'f3 t\'ednh \'f0\u7871\'3fn m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7897\'3f gia t\'e3ng c\u7911\'3fa gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f v\'e0 m\u7913\'3fc t\'edch l\u361\'3fy th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f th
\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn m\'e0 x\'e9t s\u7855\'3fp x\u7871\'3fp l\u7841\'3fi h\u7841\'3fng c\'f4ng ty cho ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp.
\par  Ngo\'e0i ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn ch\'ednh ph\'e2n h\u7841\'3fng c\'f4ng ty n\'f3i tr\'ean, khi ph\'e2n h\u7841\'3fng c\'f4ng ty c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f, B\u7897\'3f s\u7869\'3f c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f th\'eam v\'e0o nh\u7919\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 ng \'f0\u7863\'3fc \'f0i\u7875\'3fm, t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'ecnh h\'ecnh kh\'e1c c\u7911\'3fa }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\u7875\'3f ph\'e2n h\u7841\'3fng cho h\u7907\'3fp l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd.
\par  b) }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 V\u7873\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc b\u7897\'3f m\'e1y:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f4ng ty h\u7841\'3fng 1, h\u7841\'3fng 2 c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f2ng ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c sau }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  - Ph\'f2ng (ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f) k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ph\'e1t h\'e0nh v\'e0 tuy\'ean truy\u7873\'3fn
\par  - Ph\'f2ng (ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f) t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n v\'e0 h\'e0nh ch\'ednh qu\u7843\'3fn tr\u7883\'3f
\par  - Ph\'f2ng (ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f) cung \u7913\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd v\'e0 tr\u7843\'3f th\'fd\u7903\'3fng.
\par  \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f4ng ty h\u7841\'3fng 3, h\u7841\'3fng 4 c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc th\'e0nh c\'e1c ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f2ng (ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f
 c\'f4ng t\'e1c) nh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd sau:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  - Ph\'f2ng (ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f) k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ph\'e1t h\'e0nh, v\u7853\'3ft t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd tr\u7843\'3f th\'fd\u7903\'3fng v\'e0 tuy\'ean truy\u7873\'3fn.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  - Ph\'f2ng (ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f) t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n v\'e0 h\'e0nh ch\'ednh qu\u7843\'3fn tr\u7883\'3f.
\par  Nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f c\u7911\'3fa Ph\'f2ng (ho\u7863\'3fc t\u7893\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c) do gi\'e1m }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f0\u7889\'3fc c\'f4ng ty quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  C\'f4ng ty c\'f3 1 gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc v\'e0 c\'f3 t\u7915\'3f 1 \'f0\u7871\'3fn 2 ph\'f3 gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc (n\u7871\'3fu l\'e0 c\'f4ng ty h\u7841\'3f
ng 1).
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  c) }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 V\u7873\'3f bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 :
\par  Bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng ty ph\'e1t h\'e0nh XSKT thu\u7897\'3fc lo\u7841\'3fi bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f ng\'e0nh t\'e0i ch\'ednh - t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng - b\u7843\'3fo hi\u7875\'3fm.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  Vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c c\'f4ng ty c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o nh\u7919\'3fng nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f c\u7909
\'3f th\u7875\'3f nh\'fd c\'f4ng t\'e1c k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch, tuy\'ean truy\u7873\'3fn, cung \u7913\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, t\'e0i v\u7909\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n, h\'e0nh ch\'ednh qu\u7843\'3fn tr\u7883\'3f, v\'e0o \'f0\u7883\'3fnh mw\'fa
c doanh thu v\'e0 t\'edch l\u361\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\'ednh tr\'ean \'f0\u7847\'3fu bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f, v\u7899\'3fi tinh th\u7847\'3fn tinh gi\u7843\'3fm bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f, th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn s\u7917\'3f  d\u7909\'3fng h
\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng t\u7915\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi gian nh\u7857\'3fm \'f0\'e1p \u7913\'3fng nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh XSKT c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng.
\par  Ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau bi\'ean ch\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng n\'e3m do gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc c\'f4ng ty XSKT t\'ednh to\'e1n, b\'e1o c\'e1o Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh xem x\'e9t quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh. C\'e1c S\u7903\'3f T\'e0
i ch\'ednh c\u7847\'3fn nghi\'ean c\u7913\'3fu \'f0\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3fng b\'fd\u7899\'3fc thw\u7909\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc kho\'e1n qu\u7929\'3f l\'fd\'f5ng cho c\'f4ng ty XSKT.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  d) }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\ul\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 V\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333  Qu\u7929\'3f l\'fd\'f5ng tr\u7843\'3f cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, nh\'e2n vi\'ean trong c\'f4ng ty n\u7857\'3fm trong chi ph\'ed chung tr\'edch t\u7915\'3f doanh thu v
\u7873\'3f ph\'e1t h\'e0nh XSKT h\'e0ng n\'e3}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 m.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 L\'fd\'f5ng c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'e3nh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f0ao c\'f4ng ty (Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc, Ph\'f3 gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc, tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f2ng, ph
\'f3 ph\'f2ng) c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o h\u7841\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng ty v\u7853\'3fn d\u7909\'3fng theo b\u7843\'3fng l\'fd\'f5ng ch\u7913\'3fc v\u7909\'3f
 cho c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd ng\'e0nh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3f
p d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f (b\u7843\'3fng C6) ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'ednh k\'e8m ngh\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 235/H\'d0BT ng\'e0y 18/9/1985 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng, B\u7897\'3f T
\'e0i ch\'ednh s\u7869\'3f h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc x\u7871\'3fp l\'fd\'f5ng c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'e3nh }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f0\u7841\'3fo c\'e1c c\'f4ng ty XSKT \u7903\'3f c\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng.
\par  \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, nh\'e2n vi\'ean th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'ec t\'f9y theo ch\u7913\'3fc danh v\'e0 tr\'ecnh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2239849\charrsid12611333 \'f0\u7897\'3f c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi \'f0\u7875\'3f x\u7871\'3fp l\'fd\'f5ng cho th\'edch h\u7907\'3fp theo c\'e1c b\u7843\'3fng l\'fd\'f5ng trong Ngh\u7883
\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 235/H\'d0BT c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng.
\par  V\u7873\'3f ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f khen th\'fd\u7903\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f4ng ty v\'e0 c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f, nh\'e2n vi\'ean l\'e0m c\'f4ng t\'e1c XSKT, B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh s\u7869\'3f d\u7921\'3f
a v\'e0o k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch n\u7897\'3fp t\'edch l\u361\'3fy cho Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch v\'e0 k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f ti\u7871\'3ft ki\u7879\'3fm chi ph\'ed h\'e0ng n\'e3m c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4
ng ty XSKT \'f0\u7875\'3f h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f sau.
